# Third-Party Components

## agent-control-plane

- **Source**: https://github.com/coleam00/agent-control-plane
- **License**: MIT License
- **Copyright**: Copyright (c) 2026 Cole Medin
- **Used patterns**:
  - Park-at-budget/iteration-cap gate: Runs park in `awaiting_approval` state when
    hitting resource caps, preserving progress until human approval resumes work
  - Per-run token logging: Token usage (input_tokens, output_tokens, cached_input_tokens, cost_usd)
    is stored as first-class columns on every run completion

